<title>USA: Irondequoit, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Irondequoit, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $3.900 million of Irondequoit, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.63 percent.</p>
</text>
